n: 2.17.21
name: jit-heat-gate.fk
kind: source
is: The old body's 101-line gate over the leaf compiler: it counts requests per program identity in Form, has a lowerable program compiled once when its count reaches the mark, and cools. Opened by the review of 3.9, not by the study; its last commit is of 2026-11-04.
